  basicDesc: Echo Proxy
  scanDesc: 'Echo is the mentee of Riddick. He has, in some form, taught her much
    of what she knows and understands about extensive tech. She has applied to Axiom
    Networks before and has yet to hear back.


    Her current studies revolve around
    advanced biomechanics. Supposedly, some of those studies can be found somewhere
    in the house. '
  reportInfoDesc: "Proxy, Echo\n26 years old\nGraduate student at xxx university
    \nOriginally from the Hammer\n\nA plus one at the party, brought by Riddick Vector.\n\nTestimonies
    state Echo was speaking to two other attendees about school-related subjects."
